rsal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Sanctity,_the_Morninglord%27s_Keep.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Sanctity%2C_the_Morninglord%27s_Keep.png/420px-Sanctity%2C_the_Morninglord%27s_Keep.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"724\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Sanctity%2C_the_Morninglord%27s_Keep.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>It alone will judge you.<br /><br />This blade becomes more powerful when used by those who are devoted to Law, and its power increases even further when a paladin wields it.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816194628\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.101 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.151 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5929/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 46756/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 17194/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 20/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n107.23%  138.191     70 Template:IO\n100.00%  128.871      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  128.871      1 -t